was also actively involved in faculty training program of fiitjee.\n    \n\nEducational Qualification\nDegree/Certificate\nInstitute/School\nMarks\nB.Tech in\nChemical Engineering\nIndian Institute of Technology, \nKanpur\n (IITK)\n6.1/10.0\nClass XII: CBSE\nK.V.No.1 Armapur Kanpur\n75.4%\nClass X: CBSE\nK.V.No.1 Armapur Kanpur\n71.4 %\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nActivities and Honors\n                                                                                                                  \n\n\nAcademic\n\n\n\n         \n98.94 percentile\n in \nCAT 2006\n\n         \n97.03 percentile\n in \nXAT 2006\n\n         \nBest Project Award for the working model of a multipurpose mechanical winder\n\n         \nRanked 744\n in\n IIT-JEE 2001\n\n         \nRanked 78 \nin Common Entrance Exam (2001), Uttar Pradesh, among 80,000 applicants (approx.). \n\nComputational Skills\n\n\n         \nProgramming Languages\n           \n\n\n Java, Java Script\n\n         \nWeb Languages\n                         \n\n\n HTML, XML, XSLT, \nAJAX\n\n         \nDatabase\n      \n                              \n\n\n Oracle\n\n         \nOperating System\n                       \n\n\nWindows, Linux\n\n         \nOther Software\n          \n                  \n\n\nMatlab\n\n\nExtra Curricular\nAchievements\n- Organization\n\n\n         \nMember of Central Organizing Team in Techkriti ?04 (Annual Technological Festival of IIT \nKanpur\n\n\n         \nCoordinator of professional Nite in Antaragni?04 (Annual cultural festival of IIT Kanpur)\n\n         \nExecutive Member of Marketing Team at Antaragni?03 (Annual Cultural Festival of IIT \nKanpur\n).\n\n         \nCoordinator of T-shirt cell in techkriti?03 (Annual Technological Festival of IIT Kanpur)\nInterests & Hobbies\n\n         \nDriving Bikes, Traveling and watching movies\n\n         \nPuzzle solving.\n\n         \n\ninterest in equity market.\n\nMajor Projects Undertaken during Graduation\n\n         \nFinal year B.Tech project: Did a stability analysis for three-dimensional \ncoquette-poiseuille flows\n when surfactant is present at the interfaces for higher Reynolds number.\n\n\n         \nSummer Internship \nat IPCL Limited\n at Dahej in \nPolymer production division \n? Valuable working experience at \nHDPE\n. Did a complete statistical analysis for FBD for its heat requirement for different amount of mass and also suggested a different strategy for heat exchanger to save energy.\n\n         \nMultipurpose Mechanical Winder:\n Constructed a mechanical working model of a winder capable of winding thread on a spool, solenoids, twisters, wire straightening and 8-shaped thread winding with controlled pitch and inter-thread distance and adjustable length of the spool.\n                              \n\nAdditional Information\n\n         \nBasic understanding of\n Stock Markets \nand\n Financial instruments \ngained\n\nthrough NCFM modules.\n\n         \nBasic understanding of \nProbability, Statistical Modeling and SPSS\n through the course ?Statistical Inference in Sociology? offered by HSS Department, IIT Kanpur. The course covers common probability distributions, sampling and estimation, hypothesis testing, correlation and regression etc.\n\n         \nUnderstanding of customer acquisition, fraud analytics, segmentation, attrition/retention modeling.\n\nSandeep Singh\nDated:\n\n20\nth\n September 2007','Infonox Software Solutions  Ltd',9,NULL,'2007-10-15',NULL,'2007-10-15','2010-06-08 12:13:25','2010-06-08',10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,9,'0',NULL),(32,'Saravanan.K',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sunsdvdvaravadvdvnan@gmail.com',NULL,NULL,'0','09994556583','0',NULL,'0','2008-04-29',NULL,NULL,'2010-06-08 12:13:25',10,'0',NULL,'200710/15/ATT8010.html','200710/15/DOC55866.doc','RESUME\nRESUME\n\n\n                        \n     \nSARAVANAN.K\n                                              \n                         \nNo 1 \nKrishna\n Pillai Garden\n\n\nnd\n Street \nEast Jones Road\n\n                                          \n            \n\nSaidapet,\n\nChennai-15.\nMobile\n\n\n 09994556583\nEmail\n   \n: sunsdvdvaravadvdvnan@gmail.com\n         \n\n\nPROFESSIONAL\nSUMMARY\n\n\n             \n2+ years of IT Experience actively participated in Programming\n\n            \nExperience in Java, J2EE technologies ? JSP, \nServlets\n\n             \nFlexible, Ability to work effectively in Team environment\n\n             \nAbility to learn new languages and tools quickly\n\n\nWORK EXPERIENCE\n\nWorking as \nSoftware Programmer\n\nin Seven Axiom Software Consultants India Pvt. Ltd., \nChennai\n from April 2005 to Sep-2007.\n\n\nACADEMIC DETAILS\n                                  \nCourse\n       \nInstitution\n                 \nExamination Authority \nYear of Passing\nPercentage\nM.C.A\n      \nNehru\nMemorial\nCollege\n\n           \n       \nPuthanampatti\nBharathidasan\nUniversity\n        \n2005 \n      \n74%\n\nB.Sc\n   \n(CS)\nNehru\nMemorial\nCollege\n\n       \nPuthanampatti\nBharathidasan\nUniversity\n\n        \n2002 \n      \n65%\n      \n\n\nSKILL SET\n            \n\nProgramming Languages\n            \nC, C++, Core Java\nJava Technologies\n          \n            \nSwing, JDBC, Servlets, JSP\nJava Tool\n                                   \nEclipse 3.1\nMarkup Languages\n                     \nHTML, XML, Java Script\nDatabases\n                                 \nOracle 8i\nOperating Systems\n                    \nWindows NT/XP, Ms Dos, \nUnix\nServers\n                                     \nTomcat Server, Weblogic 8.1\n\n\n\nPROJECT DETAILS\n\nProject # 1\n            \n\n  \nTitle\n                 \n       \n  \n               \n  \n\n\nBug Tracking System\nEnvironment\n    \n                       \n  \n\nJava, Jsp, JavaScript, Oracle 8i\nResponsibilities\n                     \n    \n\nCoding\n               \nDescription\n\nBug Tracking System deals with the bug and resolution of the entire Organization projects. The employee is main person who inter-communicates and collaborates with the problems or bug. \nA company can use Bug tracker to enable its QA Engineers, development engineers and customer support to report defects; and marketing, product managers to file enhancement requests. \n\nProject # 2\n       \n\nTitle\n     \n                                 \n   \n\nContent Management System\nClient\n                                         \n\n\n\nwww.ChennaiMirror.com \nEnvironment\n                             \n\n\n\nJava, Jsp and Oracle 8i\nResponsibilities\n                \n        \n\n\nDesigning\n           \n         \nDescription\nContent Management System (CMS) is a method of passing information, advertising and promoting business services. CMS provides the user to compose, schedule, preview and place their classified advertisement. This System also generates to search the advertisement-according category, advertisement Id, customer Id, as per user requirements.\n\n\nPERSONAL PROFILE\n                        \nName\n                            \n: Saravanan.P\nFather?s Name\n               \n: Panneerselvam.R\nDate of Birth\n                  \n: 13\nth\n Jan 1982\nSex\n                              \n: Male\nNationality\n                     \n: Indian\nReligion\n\n            \n: Hindu\nMarital Status\n                \n: Single\nLanguages Known\n          \n: English and Tamil\nPassport No\n                  \n: F 9652809\nAddress\n                        \n: 84-A Vannan Palli,\n\nBelukurichy (\nPo\n), \n\nNamakkal (\nDt\n) - 637402.\n            \n                                    \nDECLARATION\n\n                                    \nI here by declare that all the above information is true to the best of my knowledge.\n\n\n     \n       \n\nYours faithfully,\n\n\n(SARAVANAN.P',NULL,9,NULL,'2007-10-15',NULL,'2007-10-15','2010-06-08 12:13:25','2010-06-08',10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,9,'0',NULL),(33,'Satheesh.C ',NULL,NULL,'Bangalore ','satheesscshbanvddvdvaruvsdvpalli@gmail.com',NULL,NULL,'0','9980141404','0',NULL,'0'