ytics.\n\nAchievement- Site is ranking on #1 position on most of the keyword; good conversion rate according to Pay per click campaigning, site is listed in shopping.com\n\n\n\n\n\n       \nPrince Jewellery\nURL- \nhttp://www.princejewellery.com/\n\nCountry ? \nChennai\n\nIndia\n\nDescription-Company is dealing with jewellery and diamonds.\n\nRole - Optimize the site, Banner ads (rediff.com), directory submission, traffic generation, and web analytics.\n\nAchievement- Site is ranking on #1 position on every keyword of the site.\n\n\n\n\n       \nAccusearch\nURL- \nhttp://www.accusearch.biz/\n\nCountry ? \nUnited States of America\n\nDescription - Public Record search firm\n\nRole - Optimize the site, Link exchanges, directory submission, traffic generation, and web analytics.\n\nAchievement ? Top 10 ranking for every keyword of the site.\n\n       \nGatesix Hospitality\nURL- \nhttp://www.gatesixhospitality.com/\n\nCountry ? \nUnited States of America\n\nRole ? Off page Optimization, Link exchanges, directory submission, traffic generation, Pay per click campaigning and web analytics.\n\nDescription- Provides the hotel Internet marketing solution.\n\nAchievement ? Good ranking for every keyword of the site.\n\n\n\n       \nCactus Country Property\nURL- \n\nhttp://www.cactuscountryproperty.com/\n\nCountry ? \nUnited States of America\n\nDescription- Real Estate related Services.\n\n\n\n       \nExind Fabrics\n\nURL- \nhttp://www.exindfabrics.com/\n\nCountry ?\nIndia\n\nDescription- the Hand woven Fabrics\n\n\n       \n\nApple country Resorts\n\nURL- \nhttp://www.applecountryresorts.com/\n\nCountry ?\nIndia\n\nDescription- Honeymoon vacation resorts\n\n\n       \nTrails \nIndia\n\nURL- \nhttp://www.trailsindia.com/\n\nCountry ?\nIndia\n\nDescription- Tours and Travels Company\n\n\n       \nSaffola Life\nURL- \nhttp://www.saffolalife.com/\n\nCountry ?\nIndia\n\nDescription- Healthy lifestyles and Weight Management Control\n\n\n\n       \nTruedata Online\nURL- \nhttp://www.truedataonline.com/\n\nCountry ?\nUnited States of America\n\nDescription- Dialogic PC boards and Televantage Related Products\n\n\n\n\n\nSEO Tools\n\nUrchin, Google analytics, Dream weaver, keyword generation tools, \n\n.svn , Optilink , Arelis tools, Meta Tag Generation Tools, Internet Business Promotor 8(IBP 8), and Web Position Gold etc., \n  \n\nOther Qualification(s)/ Certification(s)/ Programme(s) Attended\n\n\n       \nMAINFRAME.\n   \n\n       \nCCCO (Certificate course in computer operation).\n\n\nLanguages Known\n\n\n       \nEnglish\n\n\n       \nHindi\n\n\n       \nMarathi\n\n\n       \nTamil\n\n\nPersonal Details \n\n\nDate of Birth\n                  \n\n           \n\nth\n April 1982.\n\nFather?s Name\n               \n\n           \nMr. Ramesh Sonkusre\n\nSex \n                 \n\n           \n\n          \nMale\n\nMarital Status\n                \n\n           \nMarried\n\nHobbies\n                        \n\n           \nCricket',NULL,1,NULL,'2007-10-16',NULL,'2007-10-16','2010-06-09 12:13:49','2010-06-09',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0',NULL),(136,'Prashant Kumar',NULL,NULL,NULL,'prascscsacsdscba@gmail.com',NULL,'040 23042223','0','9959433320','0',NULL,'0','2007-04-30',NULL,NULL,'2010-06-09 12:13:49',3,'0',NULL,'200710/16/ATT40679.html','200710/16/DOC40121.doc','Prashant Kumar Penumatsa\n                                                                                          \nPrashant K\n         \n                                                                                                                          \nPlot-No.54,\n                                                       \nEmail: \nprascscsacsdscba@gmail.com\nMayuri nagar, Miyapur,\n                                    \nCell: 9959433320.\nHyderabad-560032.\n                \n                                \n040-23042223.\nCareer Objective:\n\nSeeking assignments with a technology-driven organization of repute.\n\nSummary of Experience and skills:\n                                 \n\n\n          \n3+ years of experience in IT industry.\n\n          \nWorking as \nSoftware Engineer \nfor\n HSBC Software Development, \nHyderabad\n\n\n          \nWorked for\n Iflex, \nBangalore\n from OCT2006-May2007.\n\n          \nWorked as\n\nSoftware Engineer for Zisys-IT solutions since Jan 2004- Oct 2006.\n\n          \nWorked on Oracle 9i, SQL Server2000 as Developer, Unix and shell scripting.\n\n          \nWorked as a Back-end developer on database operations as DML, DDL, DCL and TCL, Data Modeling, Creating Procedures, triggers, functions, Packages, Indexes. Exception Handling, Writing Cursors, Tuning of SQL statements.\n\n          \nInstallation, configuration and up gradation of Oracle server software.\n\n          \nExperience in Physical database design & creation. Managing the database?s storage structures and schema objects. Creation of table spaces, rollback segments, database security imposition by creation and granting of roles and privileges. Starting up and shutting down the database. Performance Tuning.\n\n          \nAble to work and communicate across culture and different people. Willingness to learn all the time. Good communication skills, adaptable to surroundings and confident to take up problems.\n\nScholastic Details:\n\n\n          \nBachelor of Technology (B.tech)\n in Computer Science and Information Technology from J.N.T.U, Hyderabad 2003.\n\n          \nMBA-Information Technology\n from \nManipal\nUniversity\n, Bangalore.(pursuing part-time) \n\n\nAdditional Qualifications:\n\n\n          \nOracle Certified\n\nAssociate\n for oracle9i DBA (SQL & Fundamentals-1).\n\n          \nMicrosoft certified\n\nprofessional\n for SQL-Server2000(Installing, configuring & administering)\n\n          \nOracle9i DBA\n from SQL * International, \nBangalore\n\n\n          \nIBM Mainframes from Signon Technologies, \nHyderabad\n\n\n          \nSQL-server UNIX from NIIT.\n\n\nIT skills:\n       \n     \nO/S\nWIN NT, MVS, \nUNIX\nLanguages\nSQL, Pl/SQL, T-SQL, COBOL\n, JCL\nRDMBS\nORACLE 9i, SQL-Server, DB2\n, VSAM.\nTools\nSql*, TOAD, Pro*c\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nProject profile:\n\n\n\nProject: 1 \nTitle\n                                    \n: BEN Support\nClient\n                                  \n\nDeutshe Bank\n\nEnvironment\n                        \n: XML, Oracle9i. \nDescription\n\nI flex\n, Business Enterprise Network (BEN) is a web-based financial project of Deutsche bank which records all the information related to it. It maintains the Database of users, employees, financial issues, Budget and costing activities.\nRole & Responsibilities:\n\n          \nAs the Central administrator am responsible for creating new DB users, Maintaining existing User records.\n\n          \nResponsible for resolving technical issues related to Database, writing queries in SQL/PLSQL.\n\n        \nUp gradation of project version.\n\n\nProject: 2\nTitle\n                                   \n: ERP, Automation of Distribution and Supply chain.\nClient\n                                 \n: DRL Hydraulics India Ltd\nEnvironment\n                       \n: V.B .NET, Oracle 9i.\nDescription\n\n Project is divided into 12 modules order Management, Designs, Material\nPlanning, indenting, Production, Sub-Contracts, QCD, Assembly, Stores, Purchase, \nMarketing & Dispatch, Tools and HRD modules. The system provides the facility to \nMonitor and control the production and inventory of items. It provides the common\nIndenting, order maintenance, purchase, order maintenance and stores modules. It \nEnables the management to streamline the flow of information among the \nDepartments to give the optimum results. This provides the features which allow the \nUses to find out the current stock level, purchases and indent details. \nRole & Responsibilities\n\n\n          \nWorked as a pl/sql developer on Order management, stores, QCD (Quality control division) & purchase modules. Menus are designed as per user need. Menu level security is also provided Development of Program Specifications & member of the team to study the existing system. \n\n\nProject : 3\nTitle\n                                   \n\nEnterprise\n Resource Information Systems.\nClient\n              \n                   \n: IDS Software solutions, \nBangalore\n\nEnvironment\n                       \n: UNIX, Java, Servlets, JDBC and HTML, Oracle9i.\nDescription\n\nENTERPRISE\n RESOURCE INFORMATION SYSTEMS (ERIS) is a computerized solution for recruiting agencies and software consultant?s. This application maintains electronic database comprises of job applicants, employees and clients. User of this system can enter and access details of all the information. The main aspect is to provide good user interface, security, validation, replication of data and auditing, if required. To reduce the load of traffic database packages are also used. Various types of reports like tabular, master-detail, matrix are generated accordingly. \nRole & Responsibilities:\n\n          \nInvolved as a Back-end developer in Designing Normalized tables and provided Coding, also involved in some of the database administration tasks.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nProject :4\nName\n                                      \n: UCS (Unified Contract System)\nClient\n                         \n             \n: Deutsche Leasing, \nGermany\nType of Project\n                         \n: Development & Enhancement\nEnvironment\n                            \n: IBM, S/390, JCL, COBOL, VSAM, DB2.\nTeam Size \n                   \n   \n         \n\n: 15\nDescription:\n    \nUCS is the process of Re-Hosting their IBM mainframe applications. We are involved in redesigning, re-engineering & development of UCS. Our Aim is to provide a single source for accessing Customer, Supplier and Prospect information for Offerings, Contracts and other core information about customer. The information is maintained in VSAM files. The system has a mix of Mainframe, Client Server, Web and proprietary Technologies. \nRole & Responsibilities:\n\n          \nDevelopment, Enhancement and Maintenance support (On-line and Batch) Coding related to Archive of Financial related Tables, analysis and Modification of impacted programs in DB2. \n\nPersonal profile:\n\nFather name\n                            \n: Sesha Vardhana Rao\nD-O-B\n                                       \n: 19 November 1981\n\n\n\n\n(P.Prashant Kumar)',NULL,1,NULL,'2007-10-16',NULL,'2007-10-16','2010-06-09 12:13:49','2010-06-09',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0',NULL),(137,'Ratheesh V.G',NULL,NULL,NULL,'vgregwergrwgash81@yahoo.com',NULL,NULL,'0','91 9850832361','0',NULL,'0','2009-07-30',NULL,NULL,'2010-06-09 12:13:49',12,'0',NULL,'200710/17/ATT22611.html','200710/17/DOC15311.doc','Curriculum Vitae\nCurriculum Vitae\n\n\n\n                                               \n     \n                                               \n                                               \n\n\nFLAT NO 7\n           \nRATHEESH V.G\n                         \nNASSEB\nPARK\n                  \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n     \n                    \n                                                                                   \nSALUNKE VIHAR\n                             \nWANOWIRE\n    \n                                                  \nPUNE \n? 411048\n                                                        \n\n                                              \nEmail: \nvgregwergrwgash81@yahoo.com\n\n                                                          \n                                            \n\nMobile: +91- 9850832361\n         \n\n\nObjective:\n\n   \n            \nMy Professional Goal is to\n\nexcel in the application of innovative technology, and develop world-class solutions to real world challenges and use my professional skills as the foundation for building a unique combination of technical aptitude with business development.\n\n\nWork Experience:\n\nAMDOCS Business Services India Pvt Ltd, Pune \n\nPosition: SME (Subject Matter Expert)\nDuration: Jan 2007- Till Date\n\nProject Name: Telecom Billing \nClient: \nBELL\nCanada\n\nKey Areas:\n\n      \nTelecom Billing systems\n\n      \nOracle \n\n      \nSQL\n\n      \nUNIX\n\n      \nEnsemble\n\n      \nClarify\n\nProject Details: \nAmdocs is using Ensemble for Billing.\nWorking platform is HP-UNIX.\nRunning Bill cycles & \nMonitoring Cycles\n for all the LOBs (Line Of Business).\nIdentifying the error by checking log file for the jobs& Sort out it through the Clarify Tickets.\n\n         \nHandling UAT team for the billing conversion activity from legacy billing system to Ensemble.\n\n         \nProviding Level 3 support for defects and production issues related to Billing Systems.\n\n         \nPlayed important role in Generation and Resolving Tickets in Clarify.\n\n         \nCoordinating with Clients and business user for new requirements / enhancements.\n\n         \nCoordinating with the Quality Assurance team related to ISO and SAS 70.\n\n         \nExecution and Monitoring the customer \nSLA\n (Service Level Agreement). \n\nOrient Technologies Pvt Ltd, Mumbai\n           \nPosition: \nSupport Engineer \nDuration:\n\nMay 2006\n-Jan 2007\n\nJob Location:\n\nTATA CONSULTANCY SERVICES\nProject Name:\n\nCorporate Telecom Billing\nClient: VSNL\n\n\n\nProject Details: \nGeneva Billing Software is used for billing& its of Converges which is the heart of our application.\nTCS is customized \nGeneva\n for VSNL\nDatabase is Oracle 9 i\nSQL is used for accessing Data Base\n\n\nWorking platform is Unix\nMediation Server collects these CDR and converts them to text files. These text files are processed by us and stored into oracle database. We can define various rate plans. We can also set various cost bands for a particular code.\nPlayed an important role from creation of customers to bill production\nBusiness Objects (BO) is used for generating reports as per requirement. \n\nJob Profile: \nWorking in on \nGeneva\n, Telecom billing software. We are doing billing for corporate customers for the services like CIT, Vciplc, and Inmarast etc.\n\n\nPosition: System Engineer\nCompany: Advanced Photonics Pvt Ltd, Mumbai\nDuration: \nMay 2005-May 2006\n\nSome of the key areas relating to my job include:\n\n      \n\nTroubleshooting technical problems of PC \n      \n\n\nInstallation of different softwares &hardware peripherals\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Overall control& Maintenance of all computers\n\nCertifications:\n\n     \nCCNA (Cisco Certified Network Associate) CSCO11054524\n\n\n\nTraining Completed:\n                                                                                                                            \n\nP.G.C.A (Post Graduate Diploma in Computer Applications)\nECIT, Hydrabad\n\nDiploma in Computer Hardware\nLogic Software Solutions, \nCochin\n, Kerala\n\n\nSoftware Exposure:\n\nOperating System: WIN 98, XP\nPackages: MS Office\nLanguage: C\n   \n\nEducational Qualifications:\n       \n\nM.Sc Industrial Electronics\n\nfrom [\nBharathidasan\nUniversity\n, Thiruchirappalli, Tamilnadu] in \n[April 2004] with First Class (16\nth\n Rank in University)\nAggregate: 77.53%\n\nB.Sc Electronics\n\nfrom [\nMahatma\nGandhi\nUniversity\n, Kottayam, Kerala] in\n[June 2001] with First Class\nAggregate: 70.25%\n\nPDC\n\nfrom [\nMahatma\nGandhi\nUniversity\n, Kottayam, Kerala\n] in\n[April 1998] with First Class\nAggregate: 74.6%\n\n\nSSLC\n\nfrom [Department Of General Education, Kerala] in \n[March 1996] with First Class\nAggregate: 63.5%\n\nCurriculum Project:\n\nTitle\n\n      \n\nPC Interfaced Speed Monitoring System \n\n\nBrief Overview of Project\n\n\nThis Project leads to measure the speed of any rotating object with high accuracy at low cost. It also gives the facility of capturing and storing the file and also can view the graph. The circuit is directly interfaced to PC through parallel port. Software program is written in C++. It was carried out at Travancore-Cochin Chemicals Ltd. Kerala. \n\nPersonal Profile:\n\n    \n      \nDate of Birth\n                        \n\n\n20-04-1981\n      \nFather?s Name\n                     \n\n\nGOPALAKRISHNAN E.T\n      \nSex\n                                    \n\n\nMALE\n      \nMarital Status\n                      \n\n\nSINGLE\n      \nLanguages Known\n                \n\n\nENGLISH, HINDI, MALAYALAM & TAMIL\n      \nNationality\n                           \n\n\nINDIAN\n      \nPermanent Address\n             \n\n\nVADAKKEMANDOPPILLIL HOUSE\n                                                \n   \nALLAPRA POST, PERUMBAVOOR\n                                                \n   \nERNAKULAM KERALA - 683 553.\n                                                                                \n                        \n\n     \nPassport Details:\n\nPassport No:\n   \nF0551346\nDate of Issue:\n\n4/10/2004\nDate of Expiry: 3/10/2014\nPlace of Issue: \nCochin\n                        \n                   \nExtra Achievements:\n\nWon Best Team member &full attendance awards from Amdocs.\nWon prizes in Quiz Competitions.\nWon prizes in Technical sensoriom.\n\nReferences:\n\nAvailable upon request.\nDeclaration\n\nI here by declare that the information furnished above is true to the best of my knowledge.\n\n                                                                                    \nPlace: Pune\n                                                                                           \n  \n   \n\nRATHEESH',NULL,1,NULL,'2007-10-17',NULL,'2007-10-17','2010-06-09 12:13:49','2010-06-09',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0',NULL),(138,'Mahammed G',NULL,NULL,'Bangalore','aamivffbvgr63@gmail.com','aamir63@gmail.com','0836 2261332','0','9986232174','0',NULL,'0','2008-04-13',10,34,'2010-06-09 12: