North America Alumni award for the best B.E. (Agri) student of the University for the academic year 2005\n\n      \nBagged Er.V.Venkatraman (Alumni) award for the Best final B. E. (Agri) student of the University for the academic year 2005.\nPERSONAL PROFILE\n\nDate of birth\n               \n\n          \n12.07.1982\nNationality\n                 \n\n          \nIndian\nSex\n                              \n\n          \nMale\nMarital Status\n             \n\n           \nSingle\nLanguages Known\n   \n\n\n           \nEnglish, Tamil\nPassport Number\n       \n\n          \nF0455319\n Valid upto \n06/09/2014\nPresent address \n          \n\n           \nRoom No: \nA5, 493\n/J, Prakruthi Youth Hostel\n                                                   \n\n\n\n\nth\n Cross, 7\nth\n Block, Jayanagar\n                                                \nBanagalore-\n82\n                                        \n        \n                       ','Tryocen Software',1,NULL,'2007-10-18',NULL,'2007-10-18','2010-06-10 12:14:22','2010-06-10',14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0',NULL),(234,'Arup C',NULL,NULL,NULL,'ardfvdfvup.chadsdfvkraborty@gmail.com',NULL,NULL,'0','09952969688','0',NULL,'0','2008-04-29',NULL,NULL,'2010-06-10 12:14:22',14,'0',NULL,'200710/18/ATT22603.html','200710/18/DOC16358.doc','Resdex @ naukri.com\nArup C\nKolkata - 700031 \nardfvdfvup.chadsdfvkraborty@gmail.com\n\nTelephone: 09952969688\n(M)\n\nD.O.B\n - 05 Apr 1980 \nModified on\n - 26 Sep 2007 \nAnnual Salary\n - INR 2 Lac(s) 40 Thousand \nTotal Years of Experience\n - 2 Year(s) 8 Month(s) \nCurrent Location\n - Chennai \nPreferred Location\n - No preference \nA software professional in ASP, Oracle, SQL server Developer and DBA',NULL,1,NULL,'2007-10-18',NULL,'2007-10-18','2010-06-10 12:14:22','2010-06-10',14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0',NULL),(235,'Debasis J',NULL,NULL,'Bangalore','debasisjedvdvdvnaa@yahoo.co.in','debasisjenaa@yahoo.co.in','09986783558','0','09986783558','0','91 9986783558','0','2008-04-13',10,34,'2010-06-10 12:14:22',2,'0',NULL,'200710/18/ATT22607.html','200710/18/DOC16359.doc','Resdex @ naukri.com\nDebasis J\nSuprit Building,5th cross, yeswantpur-22 Bangalore - 560022 \ndebasisjedvdvdvnaa@yahoo.co.in\n\nTelephone: 09986783558\n(M)\n\nD.O.B\n - 11 Jul 1980 \nModified on\n - 26 Sep 2007 \nAnnual Salary\n - INR 2 Lac(s) 55 Thousand \nTotal Years of Experience\n - 2 Year(s) 4 Month(s) \nCurrent Location\n - Bangalore \nPreferred Location\n - Anywhere in India \nMCA with over 2 years experience in Oracle Pl/Sql\n\nTEXT RESUME \n\nDebasis Jena\nMobile: +91-9986783558\nE-Mail: debasisjenaa@yahoo.co.in\nObjective:\nLooking for an admirable Position in Information Technology; in which acquired expertise, creative talents and commitment to excellence will have value for mutual growth\nSkills summary:\nOver 2.4 years of Technical experience in the field of Information Technology with core value in Oracle Pl/Sql & Unix, in the position of Programmer Consultant\nGood in Ability to think analytically, quantitative skills, Ability to integrate information from a wide variety of sources, ability to change and adapt to new situations , cultural sensitivity and awareness, ability to make decisions with imperfect information, initiative, risk-taking ability and learn new technologies and tools quickly\nGood and proficient in principles, methods, techniques, and systems of fiscal and project management\nGood in process modeling, Gathering Business Requirements, Contribute significantly to strategic decisions and Solid understanding of various technical environments and business functions\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills, accustomed to work in a team environment with tight schedules and capable of work under pressure, goal oriented, good common sense, judgments and decision making skills\nEducation:\n\n Master of Computer Application (MCA)\nDr Ambedkar Ins. Of Tech & Mgmt Sc, Rourkela, India, 2005\n\n Bachelors\n? Degree in Science (B.Sc.) with Major in Maths\nRourkela Municipality College, Rourkela, India, 2002\nTechnical Skills:\nOperating System : Ms-DOS, Windows 98/XP/NT, UNIX Shell programming\nLanguages : C, C++, Oracle pl/sql\nDatabase : Oracle 8i/9i, SQL Server 2000\nTools : MS-Word, MS-Excel, MS-PowerPoint\nProfessional Experience:\nProgrammer Consultant March\n?07~Till Date\nCCE Software Solution\nCurrently assigned in Bangalore\nGeneral Functions\nHandling in function of development, implementation & maintenance of application software. Experience includes 2 year of implementation, customization and support experience in Oracle database.\nStrong exposure in Oracle (SQL & PL / SQL), absolutely capable of working in a fast paced, dynamic & team-oriented environment, Proficient in creation of oracle database on various platforms such as Windows 98/2000/XP/NT, Has good experience in database design, Writing PL / SQL Procedures, Function and Trigger, has good experience in re-organization of databases, Implemented new features of Oracle 9i,designing, creating, operating and maintaining of Oracle databases, defragmentation of tables and indexes for improve performance and efficiency\nPROJECT EXPERIENCE:\nProject 1\nTitle : Customer Satisfaction Information System (CSIS)\nClient : Bay Bank, USA (www.baybank.org)\nTeam Size : 5\nRole : coding and design database\nEnvironment: UNIX, Oracle pl/sql\nDescription : This under developing project is to handle the issues related to Customer Satisfaction and it\n?s the prior precaution to keep the worthy-ness of the Banks client with Measuring the satisfaction level by means of various tools like online res\nponse, Mobile Banking response or any other means of feedback from the client, even through the tele-calling response about the service and future expectations from the Bank to help or satisfy them much better way in the current techno centric world\nThe Project was divided into various modules and this modules particularly designing for storing and retrieval the data for various analyses or for future actions for worthiness of the Bank as well as its clients\nBased on various sub-modules design, we need to develop the database to store some information after fetching from Master Database & Business Performance Database, whole required things will store in another database to storing the information which is keeps changing about the performance of the customer\nThe all survey responses are storing in different database for analysis purpose and again the final remarks or report generated, which is used for top level Management people to take decision for future\nProject 2\nTitle : Computerized Roll Management System (CRMS)\nClient : Rourkela Steel Plant (RSP)\nTeam Size : 8\nRole : coding and design database\nEnvironment : Windows XP, VB6.0, Oracle pl/sql\nDescription : The CRMS is the project for the Roll Turning shop of SAIL (RSP) is an application software which caters to the needs of Roll Turning Shop department of SAIL (RSP). This project is developed for analyzing the performance of Rolls, chocks, bearing that come from different departments like HSR(Hot Strip mill) ,CRM(cold rolling mill), SSM(silicon strip mill) and plate mill for grinding , repair and maintenance in the RTS.\nThe roll management system aims to the management and maintenance of the rolls along with its rolls and also the management of the chocks and bearings attached to it after working in mill. These rolls are used in HSM (Hot Strip Mill), CRM (Cold Roll Mill), Plate Mill and SSM (silicon Strip Mill) to convert thick iron slab to sheets of required thickness. Each work roll has a backup roll to support it when it is working and each of these working roll have two sides, a free side and a drive side. At the drive side the motor is fixed which helps the roll to rotate. Two working rolls rotate in opposite direction. After working for some hours and processing some tones of slabs, the working roll along with chocks , bearings and its mate roll are taken out for inspection.\nProject 3\nTitle : Financial Accounting System\nClient : Chauhan Associates\nTeam Size : 5\nRole : creating database\nEnvironment: Windows XP, VB6.0, Oracle pl/sql, Java, Servlets, JSP\nDescription: This is application is developed to handle internal accounting package of Chauhan Associates. includes latest bank balance in different accounts, incoming money and expenses expected in near future. It includes report generation of different expenditure wise. It also creates balance sheet of company, which is a match with CA balance sheet at auditing period. It also includes report that where receipt of any expenses is kept. So it reduces time of a/c department during auditing. And at the same time management can also know latest status of company balances.\nProject 4\nTitle : Client Information System\nClient : Malik Hirani & Associates (C.G.)\nPlatform : Windows98\nLanguages : VB 6.0, ORACLE\nTeam Size : 5\nRole : Designing & Managing Database, Coding\nDescription : The project entitled \'Client Information System\' deals with the maintenance of employee details such as attendance information of the employee and employee pay slip. The project also deals with the client details.\nThis project replaces the manual system of keeping track of attendance for thousands of employees. Instead of entering time manually whenever employee enters or leaves the premises of the company for whatever reasons. It also maintains the leave transactions.\nThe aim of this project is to maintain a database, which consists the details information of client as well as information of company\'s employee. This project has been made as per the requirement of a client. This project helps in keeping all the records of client as well as employee. In this project following option has been provided\n: - Adding and updating personnel records of a client as well as employee.\n: - Adding and updating their attendance records of employee.\n: - Generate payroll information of company\'s employee.\nThe project automates all these works and reduces the burden of employees and wastage of time.\nPERSONAL PROFILE\n1. Date of Birth : 11 of July 1980\n2. Father\'s Name : Mr. Hemanta Kumar Jena\n3. Marital : Single\n4. Languages Known : English, Hindi, Oriya and Bengali\n5. Corres. Address :Suprit Building,Room No:2,Yeswantpur,Bangalore-560 022\n6. Current CTC : 2.4lacs\n7. Notice period : 15 days','CCE Software Solution',1,NULL,'2007-10-18',NULL,'2007-10-18','2010-06-10 12:14:22','2010-06-10',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0',NULL),(236,'Bhaskar M',NULL,NULL,'Mumbai','bhasdvdvkar2507@yahoo.com','asdvdvki_dvdv2k1@rediffmail.com','044 26624348','0','91 022 9892624453','0',NULL,'0','2006-12-13',8,24,'2010-06-10 12:14:22',3,'0',NULL,'200710/18/ATT22610.html','200710/18/DOC16360.doc','Nitin D\nBhaskar. M\n           \n\n\nObjective\n\nSeeking a job as a Software Engineer in an organization wherein my talents get a chance to fore \nFront the Engineering challenges along with the exposure to the cutting-edge technologies\n\nExperience Summary\n\nCompany\nDesignation\nPeriod\nLandMark Solutions Pvt. Ltd.\nSoftware Programmer\nJanuary 2003 ? Till Date\n\nEducational Qualification\n\n\n       \nB.E Graduate from \nUniversity\n Of \nMadras\n in year 1998-02 with \n69\n\n\n       \nPassed HSC from Anglo Indian Board of Education in year 1996-98 with \n79\n\n\n       \nPassed SSLC from Anglo Indian Board of Education in year 1994-96 with \n77.75\n\n\nTechnical Skills\n\nInternet Technology\nHTML, Java Script, VBScript, ASP .Net\nTools\nVisual Source Safe\nDatabase\nMS-Access 2000, MS-SQL Server 7.0/2000, Oracle 9i\nLanguage\nVB .Net, MS Visual Basic 6.0, C, C++\nJob Functions\nRequirement Analysis, Gap Analysis, Design, Coding, Testing, Documentation, Maintenance\nOthers\nCrystal\n Reports 10\n\n\nProfessional Profile\n\nCompany Name: Landmark Solutions Pvt. Ltd.\n\nERP System\n\nProject\n            \n     \n      \n: Rsmart (ERP System)\nType\n                \n     \n     \n\n: Design, Development\nPlatform\n                      \n: Windows 2000, IIS\nSoftware\n         \n     \n       \n: ASP.NET, VB.Net, MS-SQL Server 2000, \nCrystal Report 10\nClient\n                           \n: Balbharati \nDuration\n                      \n: June 2004 To Till Date\n\nRsmart is an ERP Product, which includes different modules like Administration, Sales & Distribution, Purchase, Material management, Quality control, Production Planning, Financial Accounting, Project Management, Budget Management, HR [Recruitment, EIS, Training, Appraisal, etc?], Payroll, Customer care and Excise & Taxation.\nPrepared the system study report of Academic, Research, Library management and Production modules.\n\nResponsibilities\n\n          \nSystem Study report\n\n          \nGap Analysis\n\n          \nSRS, FSD, SDD Documentation\n\n          \nUser interface designing\n\n          \nReport designing\n\n          \nCoding\n\nHRM System\n\nProject\n            \n     \n      \n: HRsmart (HRM system)\nType\n                \n     \n     \n\n: Design, Development\nPlatform\n                \n      \n: Windows 2000, IIS\nSoftware\n         \n            \n: ASP.NET, VB.Net, \nOracle 9i\n\nCrystal Report 10\nClient\n                           \n: ICICI Prudential \nDuration\n                      \n: June 2003 To May 2004\n\nHRsmart is a Human Recourse management System that manages EIS (Employee Information System), Recruitment, Appraisals, Leave management, Polices, Promotions, Transfers, Loan, Claims and Employee Separation. Report is generated for payroll processing and payroll process data is updated to system.\n\nResponsibilities\n\n          \nSystem Study report\n\n          \nSRS, FSD, SDD Documentation\n\n          \nUser interface designing\n\n          \nReport designing\n\n          \nCoding\n\n          \nDeployment\n\n\nPersonal Details\n\nContact Address: \n201, \nA-Wing\nShivnera\nPlaza\nBuilding\n\n                              \nSector ? 15, Sanpada, Behind Vashi Railway Station,\n                              \nNavi Mumbai.\n                              \nCell Phone: +91-022-9892624453\n\nPermanent Address:\n\n79,\nChellapa Street\n\n                                 \n\nOtteri, Chennai-600012. \n                                 \n\nTamilNadu\n                                    \nPhone® - 044-26624348.\n\n    \n            \nEmail:\n\nbhasdvdvkar2507@yahoo.com\n            \n\nasdvdvki_dvdv2k1@rediffmail.com\n                                \n\nDate of Birth:\n\n25\nth\n July 1980\n\nLanguage Comprehended:\n     \nEnglish, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil.\n\n\n\nPlace:\n Navi Mumbai\n                                                                                                                       \nBHASKAR.M','LandMark Solutions Pvt. Ltd',1,NULL,'2007-10-18',NULL,'2007-10-18','2010-06-10 12:14:22','2010-06-10',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0',NULL),(237,'Pankaj Ramesh sonkusre',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sonkusre@gmail.com',NULL,NULL,'0','731 9893175181','0',NULL,'0','2007-04-30',NULL,NULL,'2010-06-10 12:14:22',3,'0',NULL,'200710/18/ATT4889.html','200710/18/DOC16361.doc','Resume\n\nC/O Mr. Mohan Roy, 19-Giridhar Nagar\nIndore (Madhya Pradesh) -India\nTelephone: (Res.) 91+731+9893175181\nEmail: sonkusre@gmail.com\n\n\n\nObjectives\n\n\n       \nAttain a challenging position in Web Promotional activities.\n\n\n       \nBring out the best within me and utilize it to serve the Industry.\n\n\nProfessional Summary\n\n\n       \nSEO Experience: 3 years.\n\n\n       \nCurrent Designation: Sr. Internet Marketing Specialist\n\n\nEducation\n\n\n       \nM.Sc.\n\nMathematics from Amravati University, Maharashtra (Pursuing).\n\n\n       \nB.Sc.\n\n(Computer Science)\n   \nfrom Amaravati University, Maharashtra in 2004.\n\n\n\nProfessional Experience\n\nCurrently working as \nSr. Internet\n Marketing Specialist\n in \nGatesix Technologies India Pvt. Ltd\n. ,\n Based in Indore (Madhya Pradesh).\n\nWorked as \nSEO Expert\n in\n\nD?zine Gar